Trello
  
10 expert tips for starting a new job to ensure success
 
Top execs give new hires less than three months to prove their value. Here's how to make a good first impression and get up to speed quickly – even if you feel like you're faking it 'til you make it.  
 
Make good impressions
>> https://blog.trello.com/starting-a-new-job-and-first-week-success?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-september2023-newsletter1_EML-16131&jobid=106206872&subid=1751586021&send_date=9/19/2023
  
The 5 best morning routine ideas of highly-productive people
 
A good morning routine sets the productivity tone for the day. But is it really as simple as a morning ritual and a healthy breakfast? Here's what the experts have to say. 
 
Crush your morning
>> https://blog.trello.com/best-productive-morning-routines?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-september2023-newsletter1_EML-16131&jobid=106206872&subid=1751586021&send_date=9/19/2023
 
A 5-step guide to the strategic planning process
 
Implementing a new strategy is a challenging task, and it requires alignment from the top tiers of leadership down to your frontline employees. By following a series of detailed steps, your organization can achieve its goals over time.  
 
You've got this
>> https://blog.trello.com/enterprise/strategic-plan-into-day-to-day-work?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-september2023-newsletter1_EML-16131&jobid=106206872&subid=1751586021&send_date=9/19/2023
  
Still itching to use your PTO before summer is officially over? 
 
Planning a vacation is exciting: researching what you'll see, where you'll stay, and what you'll eat. A cheap airfare quote pops up in your inbox and suddenly the world is your oyster. See how Trello can help you plan your next dream adventure.  
 
Take that vacation
>> https://blog.trello.com/all-a-board-plan-a-vacation-with-trello?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-september2023-newsletter1_EML-16131&jobid=106206872&subid=1751586021&send_date=9/19/2023
  
Have you joined the Work Management Community yet? 
 
Learn and share tips, tricks, and new ways to use Confluence, Trello, Atlas, and other tools for Work Management in this new community group.
 
Join now
>> https://community.atlassian.com/t5/Work-Management/gh-p/work-management?utm_source=newsletter-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=trello-september2023-newsletter1_EML-16131&jobid=106206872&subid=1751586021&send_date=9/19/2023
 
